  Demetrius\, an African American man\, meet and fall in love in rural Mi
 ssissippi. Rated R\; 118 minutes. $13.75 ($8.50 members) Introduced by R
 achael Z. DeLue\, director of the Princeton Humanities Initiative and th
 e Christopher Binyon Sarofim ’86 Professor in American Art in the Depa
 rtment of Art & Archaeology and the Effron Center for the Study of Ameri
