SUMMARY:Friends of Princeton University Library: Tour of ReCAP
DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Princeton University Library for a be
 hind-the-scenes look at ReCAP. What is ReCAP? ReCAP (Research Collection
 s and Preservation Consortium) is an off-campus storage facility with mo
 re than 18 million books shared with Harvard\, Columbia\, Yale\, and the
  New York Public Library. The ReCAP team will provide a tour of the faci
 lity and share how the collections are stored and processed. Books ship 
 out daily to and from Princeton and the other institutions -- and the Fr
 iends will get an exclusive inside look. The group will meet at 10:15 a.
 m. at the ReCAP facility. Current Frie\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events
 /2026/friends-princeton-university-library-tour-recap
