SUMMARY:Roundtable on German Elections
DESCRIPTION:Regional elections in the east of Germany have shocked the Ge
 rman political system\, and raised doubts about the survivability of the
  current government and the centrist coalition that constitutes its supp
 ort. Is there a return to the unstable politics of the Weimar Republic i
 n the early 1930s\, when the combination of extreme right and extreme le
 ft destroyed democracy? What role does the economic stagnation and the g
 eopolitical threat from Russia play in the destruction of the old mainst
 ream political parties of the Federal Republic?\nhttps://www.princeton.e
 du/events/2026/roundtable-german-elections
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/roundtable-german-elections
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
