 lan Sekula (Verso\, 2025)\, the first monograph on Allan Sekula (1951–
 2013)\, the award-winning anti-capitalist artist\, photographer\, filmma
 ker\, and theorist. Amphibious Realities was named a Library Journal Bes
 t Book of 2025. Combining images and essays\, Sekula’s work examined 
