 e Data Stewardship series will go over some motivations for publishing d
 ata\, how to apply the FAIR (Findable\, Accessible\, Interoperable\, and
  Reusable) principles\, what to look for when choosing a data repository
 \, and go over a typical data deposit workflow. The Research Data Stewar
 dship series consists of four lectures digging into the phases of the da
 ta lifecycle. Sign up for each individual session you are interested in!
